Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for formOptions. Construct feasible alternatives such as resequencing, substitution, or phased completion within approved design constraints. Obtain exact estimates from authorized services, disclose assumptions, and preserve professional review requirements for structural or safety consequences. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
